  "notes": "Icy Veins (https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-classic/classic-enchanting-profession-and-leveling-guide) returned HTTP 403 / a Cloudflare bot check, so no Icy Veins alternatives were recorded. Wowhead offers no alternative recipes on this path (it only says you can also Disenchant low-level items in 2-90). Product item IDs, per-craft reagents and learnAt come from Wowhead's classic spell pages for the guide's spell IDs and match the guide's material totals. Craft counts the guide marks approximate ('~'): 50-90 (60), 156-185 (40), 201-220 (25), 235-250 (25), 250-265 (20), 265-294 (30). Vendor formulas named in the guide: Enchant Cloak - Minor Agility item 11039 (Ashenvale/Stonetalon), Enchant Bracer - Lesser Strength item 11101 (Ashenvale/Stonetalon), Lesser Mana Oil item 20754 (Silithus), Enchant Shield - Greater Stamina item 16217 (BoP, Undercity/Darnassus), Runed Arcanite Rod item 16243 (Moonglade). Wowhead's data for Enchant Bracer - Minor Health (7418) says learnedat 70 but its orange threshold is 0 and the guide uses it from skill 2, so learnAt is recorded as 1. Wowhead's data for Lesser Mana Oil says it creates item 20747 with count 0; made is recorded as 1. Runed Copper Rod, Minor Health and Superior Defense have no source flag on their spell pages; recorded as trainer because the guide names no formula for them. Runed rods are reusable tools (one craft each; keep them). The guide's 1-300 materials list doesn't match its own steps for Illusion Dust (list 82, steps 50) or Soul Dust (list 130, steps 122); the steps are recorded."
